# ARP's Weave page: T2 woven with T1's beat by rhythm (the kit's sounds as notes), KEEP AS PATTERN into P2; COND's ARP
# opens on Weave
wait 300
# (WARP-8: a new project is eight kits; this scenario's melodic tracks are sample tracks)
knob 2 engine 6
knob 3 engine 6
knob 4 engine 6
knob 5 engine 6
knob 6 engine 6
knob 7 engine 6
knob 8 engine 6
wait 40
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
hits 1 1 3 ..x...x...x...x.
notes 2 1 1 1 100 C4
notes 2 1 3 1 100 E4
notes 2 1 5 1 100 G4
notes 2 1 7 1 100 B4
press HOME
turn ALGO 1
release HOME
tap ARP
turn SELECT 1
wait 50
